    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "chapters... that sounds so optimistic. but it's not a new chapter. it's just the end. i look at people who have what i used to have and i realize i'll never be one of them again. there's no way back from this. it's just too much noise and shame. i'm just tired of pretending there's a point to rebuilding a ruin.",
